==Battleground==
*1 [[Lucky Sloth]] spawns as the boss after 0.07 seconds<sup>2f</sup>.
*4 [[Dark Otter]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*3 [[Lucky Dags]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*4 [[Metal Hippoe]]s spawn after 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*4 [[Lucky Dags]] spawn after 75 seconds<sup>2,250f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Break through the Metal Hippoes and Dark Otters quickly by using [[:Category:Anti-Dark Cats|anti-Dark Cats]] with [[Massive Damage|massive damage]] or [[Insane Damage|insane damage]] abilities and cats that can perform [[Critical Hit]]s reliably.

Even though the Lucky Dagses are single-target, they can snipe your attackers effectively whenever Lucky Sloth's knockback deactivates the hitboxes of your surviving Erasers. So once no more Metal Hippoes or Dark Otters are around, it is time to pile up your attackers.

